# Generic synthesis of nb_dcache_top (open-source yosys flow).
# Input is sv2v-converted Verilog (yosys' native parser can't take the rich SV).
# The tag/data/MSHR arrays use asynchronous reads, so yosys lowers them to
# flip-flops here; in real silicon the tag and data arrays become SRAM macros
# (see README "roadmap to silicon"). This run proves the design maps to gates
# and reports cell area (control logic + storage).
read_verilog -sv nb_dcache_synth.v
hierarchy -top nb_dcache_top
synth -top nb_dcache_top
abc -g cmos2
stat
